From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom: add the exact Uke Gen1 and DP HBR2 profile

Map the Uke OEM normal USB tuning to the upstream v3 bank layout.
Preserve the distinct A/B lane settings with native per-lane masks.
Use the 4nm-v1.1 DP rate tables and exact Uke voltage/pre-emphasis matrices,
including its 0x07 PLL IVCO. This adds a dormant compatible, not a
Type-C DT graph, firmware qualification or physical acceptance.

Source: MiCode/kernel_devicetree 94c84aeb9e517dbde546fc732033c184094c8e57
Source: MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource 5712080a4b0c0b1a879e6d145c601c649ddaddfd
Source: MiCode/vendor_qcom_opensource_display-drivers 44275c404a677d9d9e5230fedd1af2ef02fc7b9a
License: GPL-2.0-only

